{"text": "Inside the time machine, there were two other travelers. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Eckels sat down and closed his eyes. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He felt the machine moving under his feet. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> After only a few minutes, the machine stopped. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> We have just arrived in the jungle of 60 million years ago, Travis explained. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Do you see the path over there. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> You must not leave it at any time. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Do not touch anything. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> You might kill something by accident. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> A little change here can cause something unthinkable in the future. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Slowly, everyone got out of the time machine. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The jungle was covered in fog. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It was very quiet.", "alignment": {"characters": ["I", "n", "s", "i", "d", "e", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", " ", "m", "a", "c", "h", "i", "n", "e", ",", " ", "t", "h", "e", "r", "e", " ", "w", "e", "r", "e", " ", "t", "w", "o", " ", "o", "t", "h", "e", "r", " ", "t", "r", "a", "v", "e", "l", "e", "r", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "E", "c", "k", "e", "l", "s", " ", "s", "a", "t", " ", "d", "o", "w", "n", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "c", "l", "o", "s", "e", "d", " ", "h", "i", "s", " ", "e", "y", "e", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "H", "e", " ", "f", "e", "l", "t", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "m", "a", "c", "h", "i", "n", "e", " ", "m", "o", "v", "i", "n", "g", " ", "u", "n", "d", "e", "r", " ", "h", "i", "s", " ", "f", "e", "e", "t", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "A", "f", "t", "e", "r", " ", "o", "n", "l", "y", " ", "a", " ", "f", "e", "w", " ", "m", "i", "